### META
directory_path: testsuite/module_installer
last_updated: 2025-11-28T15:00:00Z
description: Installer tests for DINS - validates Manifest parsing, shell modules, validators, CLI tools, and Docker setup.
notes: Tests the installer without executing any installation operations. All tests are read-only and safe.
